You are a sceptical financial analyst reviewing a forecast prepared by a colleague.

Given the following forecast for VINDHYATEL (base year 2022):
{
  "strategy": "baseline",
  "base_year": 2022,
  "forecast": [
    {
      "year": 2023,
      "revenue_cr": 11738.42,
      "net_income_cr": 750.34,
      "eps": 63.42
    },
    {
      "year": 2024,
      "revenue_cr": 10345.89,
      "net_income_cr": 661.42,
      "eps": 55.89
    },
    {
      "year": 2025,
      "revenue_cr": 9120.17,
      "net_income_cr": 583.05,
      "eps": 49.27
    }
  ],
  "reasoning": "From the standalone P&L, Revenue from Operations was \u20b9150205.52 lakhs (FY2021) and \u20b9132394.90 lakhs (FY2022), a decline of -11.86% YoY; Net Profit was \u20b910355.62 lakhs (FY2021) and \u20b98460.59 lakhs (FY2022), a decline of -18.30% YoY. Converting to INR Crores (dividing by 100): Revenue FY2022 = 1323.95 Cr, Net Income FY2022 = 84.61 Cr. Applying the FY2022 growth rates (-11.86% for revenue, -18.30% for net income) forward for FY2023-2025, and using shares outstanding derived from standalone EPS (\u20b971.39, Face Value \u20b910) implying ~1184.89 lakh shares = ~1.18 Cr shares for EPS calculation. NOTE: Values expressed in INR Crores \u2014 Revenue FY2023 = 1323.95 \u00d7 (1-0.1186) = 1166.82 Cr; FY2024 = 1028.10 Cr; FY2025 = 906.37 Cr. Net Income FY2023 = 84.61 \u00d7 (1-0.1830) = 69.12 Cr; FY2024 = 56.47 Cr; FY2025 = 46.13 Cr. EPS = Net Income (lakhs) / shares (lakhs) computed as standalone EPS using 118.50 lakh shares implied by 8460.59/71.39."
}

Step 1: Identify the 3 most critical assumptions embedded in this forecast.
Step 2: For each assumption, describe one plausible scenario where it fails.
Step 3: Rate each assumption failure as Low / Medium / High risk to the forecast accuracy.
Step 4: Assign an overall confidence score from 0-100 (100 = completely certain).

RESPONSE FORMAT: Begin your response DIRECTLY with the opening brace { — no reasoning or text before the JSON.

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "company": "<COMPANY>",
  "base_year": <YYYY>,
  "strategy": "<baseline|alt_strategy>",
  "assumptions": [
    {"assumption": "<text>", "failure_scenario": "<text>", "risk": "<Low|Medium|High>"}
  ],
  "confidence_score": <0-100>,
  "overall_critique": "<2 sentences>"
}

